WEBVTT

00:19:59.996 --> 00:20:04.996
You can always find me at my other job as
host of NPR's TED Radio Hour. Oh yeah.

00:20:04.996 --> 00:20:09.246
You can also email me any time
at Zig-Zag at Stable Dotcom.

00:20:09.704 --> 00:20:12.829
Tell me how this Zig-Zag project
thing is going for you.

00:20:15.704 --> 00:20:19.371
Many thanks to audio engineers and
composers David Herman and Dan Tesla,

00:20:19.829 --> 00:20:22.454
to Lauren Reimer for this
season's illustration,

00:20:23.038 --> 00:20:26.496
Zig-Zag as a member of the TED Audio
Collective and comes from

00:20:26.496 --> 00:20:28.163
Stable Genius Productions.

00:20:28.746 --> 00:20:32.038
I'm a newcomer and thank you
so much for listening.